<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>SuperGlide script, i recomend to put it in the letter V. It works in 45% with 144 FPS.
Credit to me lol</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 44 1
Delay 10 ms
KeyUp 44 1
Delay 0 ms
KeyDown 25 1
Delay 10 ms
KeyUp 25 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Apex Legends</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>